  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Assistance to IDPs and other vulnerable population groups</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to support the vulnerable population of Odesa region living  in Berezovsky, Odesa and Rozdilnyansky districts, to provide humanitarian assistance (food, hygiene kits, thermal underwear) to the beneficiaries of the project, with the possibility of providing exceptional emergency assistance using the approach of &#x201C;cash for protection&#x201D; in the form of a cash payment or the purchase of the essential equipment to ensure dignity of the beneficiaries and support the needs, which are not covered by basic provision of services such as food, hygiene, shelter.</narrative>
  </description>
